      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Rendered with --font zh --font ko --font latin --lang zh,ko,latin. The CJK modules are the largest of the bundle; only the glyphs a document uses are embedded. pdfnative 1.8.0 reads the GSUB extension lookups these fonts rely on. Japanese has its own sample (02-japanese.json)."
    },
